1.  Summary:

    Docker Compose setup encapsulating "Start All Windows Core Services" task.
    Provides containerized environment replicating development experience.
    Includes 5 containerized services mirroring original tasks.
    Uses nginx instead of caddy for reverse proxy services.
    Supports cross-platform deployment with lightweight Alpine containers.

